","new files publish on the first Sunday monthly","downloads are local-authority GML files under OGL conditions"]},{"source_id":"hmlr_national_polygon_lifecycle_cross_product","authority":"HM Land Registry","url":"https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/datasets/nps/tech-spec/1?back=true","accuracy_score":100,"verified_facts":["National Polygon defines Poly_ID, Title_No, INSERT, UPDATE, Vers_No and Rec_Status","INSPIRE is a subset with a simpler public schema","cross-product fields require explicit product provenance"]}],"operations":[{"line":288,"operation":"REQUIRE_OPEN_UPRN_RELEASE_NOTE_IDENTITY","status":"PASS","detail":"each Open UPRN archive retains its documented release-note and epoch identity"},{"line":289,"operation":"REQUIRE_OPEN_UPRN_SOURCE_CURRENCY_DATE","status":"PASS","detail":"source-data currency is retained separately from package publication"},{"line":290,"operation":"REQUIRE_OPEN_UPRN_EXPECTED_FEATURE_COUNT","status":"PASS","detail":"the official full-supply count is captured before runtime hydration"},{"line":291,"operation":"COMPARE_RUNTIME_COUNT_WITH_RELEASE_MANIFEST","status":"PASS","detail":"hydrated row count must equal the selected release manifest before completeness is claimed"},{"line":292,"operation":"REJECT_COUNT_MISMATCH_AS_COMPLETE_SUPPLY","status":"PASS","detail":"a count mismatch remains incomplete even when the archive opens successfully"},{"line":293,"operation":"REQUIRE_OPEN_UPRN_FULL_SUPPLY_MODE","status":"PASS","detail":"accepted OS Open UPRN packages must be full-supply snapshots"},{"line":294,"operation":"REJECT_OPEN_UPRN_AOI_ASSUMPTION","status":"PASS","detail":"no area-of-interest subset is treated as an official complete package"},{"line":295,"operation":"REJECT_OPEN_UPRN_COU_ASSUMPTION","status":"PASS","detail":"no change-only package is expected or fabricated for Open UPRN"},{"line":296,"operation":"TIMESTAMP_OPEN_UPRN_KNOWN_ISSUE_CHECK","status":"PASS","detail":"the official issue-status page check time is retai